18.46]I don't fuck with none of these niggas like I'm racist, ayy (Yeah)\n[01:21.48]My songs on that bad bitch playlist (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:25.24]Pills knockin' at my door, I'm finna let 'em in (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:30.90]Ballin' hard, feel like D. Rose, I need a letterman (Yee-haw)\n[01:32.64]I can't fuck that bitch if she don't give me her consent (Yee-haw)\n[01:34.60]Half of these hoes don't even give me erection (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:36.42]If you with that shit, then up your gat, let it spit, oh (Grrah, grrah)\n[01:39.08]I know niggas bangin' they flags like Confederate, oh (Slatt, slatt, slatt)\n[01:41.96]Brand-new house, it's on the Hills, just got the settlements off (Rich, rich, rich)\n[01:44.76]Lately, I've been ridin' dirt bikes, G-Money told me, \"Don't fall off\" (Oh)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:47.74]I've been on my KTM drip, hopefully I don't fall off (Yeah, skrrt)\n[01:50.98]In the desert, on a dirt bike with an AR, lettin' it all off (Woah, woah, grrah)\n[01:54.14]My lil' bitch'll set you up, yeah, she a dog, oh (Woah, woah, she a dog)\n[01:56.98]Get you in the bedroom just to shoot your balls off, pause\n[02:00.60]She come back home, tell me you dead, my dick is in her jaw (Uh-huh)\n[02:03.52]I could never end up like my dad, I'm too much of a boss (Uh-huh)\n[02:06.54]Oxycodone all up in my head, I'm scratchin' through the walls (Uh-huh)\n[02:09.50]High as hell, on my phone, groupies tryna get in my drawers (Woah)\n[02:12.50]Foreign bitch up in my Snapchat, showin' ass (What else?)\n[02:15.36]I know she don't love me for real, she just want the bag (What the fuck else?)\n[02:18.32]She gon' do me and my team for a Louis bag (What the fuck else?)\n[02:21.30]Grip the choppa with the beam (Brrt), this a new Louis bag, uh (Louis bag, oh)\n[02:24.60]I go shoppin' everywhere, I don't look at tags (Look at tags)\n[02:27.52]Wear it once, then throw it away, I don't take it back (Uh-huh)\n[02:30.32]Said she loved me, stupid bitch, you should take it back (Uh)\n[02:33.34]I'ma d